@startuml sequence-lesson-exercise-retry-m23
title SEQ-05: Lesson / Exercise Execution & Controlled Retry Flow (UC-05 / BF-09 / BF-10)
autonumber
skinparam style strictuml
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam ParticipantPadding 10

actor "Learner" as Learner
boundary "Web Learner Client\n(SCR-L-07 / SCR-L-08)" as Web
control "Lesson Service\n(Route Handler / BFF)" as LessonSvc
control "Supabase Storage\n(Audio & Media Buckets)" as Storage
database "PostgreSQL Database\n(PostgREST / RLS)" as DB

== 1. Load Published Lesson Content ==
Learner -> Web: Select available Lesson (SCR-L-07)
activate Web
Web -> LessonSvc: GET /api/curriculum/lessons/{lessonId}
activate LessonSvc
LessonSvc -> DB: Query published Lesson, Vocabulary, and Exercise list (status = 'PUBLISHED')
activate DB
DB --> LessonSvc: Return Lesson payload (5 canonical exercises: MCQ, FILL, REORDER, LIS, GRM)
deactivate DB

opt Word-level LISTENING Exercise
    LessonSvc -> Storage: Resolve audio asset URL (Direct RLS-mediated storage boundary: vocabulary/{vocabId}/{filename})
    activate Storage
    alt Audio Asset Available
        Storage --> LessonSvc: Return valid audio URL
    else Audio Missing / Storage Unavailable
        Storage --> LessonSvc: 404 Not Found
        note right of LessonSvc
            Audio Failure Exception:
            System produces recoverable empty/error state.
            Learner can skip audio or use fallback text without app crash.
        end note
    end
    deactivate Storage
end

LessonSvc --> Web: 200 OK { lesson, exercises, vocabularies }
deactivate LessonSvc
Web --> Learner: Render Exercise Runner

== 2. First-Pass Exercise Execution ==
loop For each of 5 exercises
    Learner -> Web: Submit answer for exercise
    Web -> LessonSvc: POST /api/curriculum/exercises/{id}/verify { answer }
    activate LessonSvc
    LessonSvc -> LessonSvc: Grade answer & lookup rule explanation
    LessonSvc --> Web: 200 OK { isCorrect: boolean, explanation: string }
    deactivate LessonSvc
    Web --> Learner: Display immediate green/red feedback + explanation
end

== 3. Controlled Retry Phase (Policy D7) ==
Web -> Web: First-pass completed with k incorrect exercises\nCalculate retry allowance: max(1, floor(5 * 0.10)) = 1

alt Has Incorrect Answers (k > 0)
    Web --> Learner: Present Controlled Retry Modal (SCR-L-08)
    Learner -> Web: Attempt retry on allowed incorrect question
    Web -> LessonSvc: POST /api/curriculum/exercises/{id}/retry { answer }
    activate LessonSvc
    LessonSvc -> LessonSvc: Grade retry attempt
    alt Retry Correct
        LessonSvc -> LessonSvc: Award 70% credit score (Policy D7)
    else Retry Incorrect
        LessonSvc -> LessonSvc: Award 0% credit score
        LessonSvc -> DB: Route error evidence to Concept / KnowledgeGap
        activate DB
        DB --> LessonSvc: Evidence recorded
        deactivate DB
    end
    LessonSvc --> Web: 200 OK { isCorrect, creditScore: 0.70 }
    deactivate LessonSvc
end

== 4. Lesson Completion & Progress Persistence ==
Web -> LessonSvc: POST /api/curriculum/lessons/{lessonId}/complete
activate LessonSvc

LessonSvc -> DB: UPSERT "UserProgress" (\n  userId = auth.uid(), lessonId = lessonId,\n  status = 'COMPLETED', completedAt = now(), score = finalScore\n)
activate DB
DB --> LessonSvc: Progress updated
deactivate DB

note right of LessonSvc
    Invariants (M2.2 P1-06):
    - Lesson completion is owned by UC-05 / BF-10 upon completing
      all first-pass items and available retry allowance.
    - ZERO 80% retry floor exists for completion.
    - Exercise Correctness != Lesson Completion != Mastery != Proficiency.
end note

LessonSvc --> Web: 200 OK { status: "COMPLETED", finalScore: finalScore }
deactivate LessonSvc
Web --> Learner: Display Lesson Completion Summary (SCR-L-09) -> Updates Streak (initiates SEQ-07)
deactivate Web

@enduml
